-cite-scope\">11</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">τιμωρία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.2</span> </span>, and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.494</span> </span>.</div></div>"}